break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんお料理せんけわからんけど、すだちって、ちょっと酸っぱいやつよね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すだちってどんな時に使ったらいいのー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"調味料とかになるんかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんからして関西弁ってなまってるん?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なまっとる(^ω^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪出身のメンバーと話してたら(おぉ関西弁ー)て思うもんー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はぶてちょるけぇ」って大阪の友達に言ったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はぶてちょる?なんじゃそりゃ」って言われた(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに山口でもはぶてるって使うよ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ\"はぶてる\"って伝わらんよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"\"←このちょんちょん付けるほど珍しい言葉じゃないのに!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなーはぶてるを標準語にしようよーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島は語尾に\"ちょる\"ってつけて話す?(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがね、\"ちょる\"は広島は使わんのんよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島は語尾に\"とる\"ってつけるのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ読んどるー、ごはん食べとるー、こんな感じよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東ではマックで関西ではマクドって言うゆーねんで!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはどっちなんかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島はマック!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マクドってゆーのは、全国でも関西だけなんよ(*'ω`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九州とか東北とかはマックて言うっぽーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"富山にもカターレ富山というＪ２のサッカーチームがあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カターレ富山!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふれーふれーカターレ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現地まで会いにいって応援したいところだけど、とりあえずブログを通して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エールを送ります(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉来たときコバトン見たかな!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こばとん??み、みてなーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こりゃ埼玉メンバー、埼玉出身のみなさんに聞くしかだねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こばとんてどんな子なの?かわいーい(^ω^)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4549332/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新潟県に来たことありますか＼(^O^)／?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないのー一回行ってみたいなって思ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪とかきれいだろうし、お米が美味しいんだよね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー素敵っ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}}